  "details": "VRChat currently saves all the config data locally and has so for a while, but a caveat that I always have with that is the fact that my settings never transfer over to another computer or if I reinstall the game. I then have to spend the time re-setting up everything and playing that tutorial again. That is why I would suggest using Steam Cloud to save the player's config files, so they and myself don't have to re-setup everything again.",
